---
---

<div class="beauty">
  <header class="reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Why beauty.</p>
    <h2>Why we made<br>it beautiful.</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="copy">
    <p class="reveal">
      Most AI hardware is a black plastic puck. It works, but it doesn't belong.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal">
      AI lives close to us — on our bodies, on our desks, in the homes of the
      people we love. It deserves the same care we give the things we already
      keep around us. A wedding ring. A reading lamp. A favorite coat.
    </p>
    <p class="reveal closer">
      So we made Fountain something you would choose, not just tolerate.
      The materials, the weight, the finish. The thinking shows.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .beauty {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  header {
    max-width: 480px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-meta);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  header h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.038em;
    line-height: 0.98;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .copy {
    max-width: 520px;
  }
  .copy p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 1.4em;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .copy .closer {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .beauty {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }
  }

  [data-revealed="true"] header { transition-delay: 0ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 200ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 340ms; }
  [data-revealed="true"] .copy p:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 500ms; }
</style>
